	(gr_text "Upload & Debugging:\n- Connect STLink → 'STLink' pinheader.\n- Connect FC → 'DEBUG' port.\nModule Test (ex. GPS):\n- Connect the 'GPS' port to the module (e.g., GPS) \n  and the FC.\n- Probe the pinheader with a logic analyzer \n  or oscilloscope to verify signals"
